          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiri kilooín i warqayé' tari káh, «Ma ooaán? Bara ooaán, ‹Amór naa daáhh a amór Mungú›, tin bay, ‹Ahaá ala, musa haratlinti'i'iiká?› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An ooána, ‹Amór naa daáhh a amór muu›? » Ala tay da'ayuút adoodá' ooaro, asma múk yaariír Yohane gwaa tsaáhh adór tar aarusmoó ló'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
